hadiths[53]{hadithnumber,text}:
"919","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rozah dhaal hai. To na behuda baat karey aur na jaahaalat karey. Aur agar koi us se ladey ya use gaali dey to kahey: Beshak main rozey se hun, do martaba. Aur qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Rozeydaar key munh ki boo Allah Taala key paas musk ki khushbu se zyada umda hai. Wo apna khaana aur apna peena aur apni khwaahish meri wajah se chhorey huey hai. Rozah merey liye hai aur main uska badla dunga. Aur neki das guna hai. (Bukhari: 4981)"
"920","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein darwaaza hai jisey Rayyaan kaha jaata hai. Us se Qiyaamat key din rozeydaar daakhil hongey, us se unkey siwa koi daakhil na hoga. Kaha jaaeyga: Rozeydaar kahaan hain? To wo khadey hongey, us se unkey siwa koi daakhil na hoga. Phir jab wo daakhil ho jaaengey to band kar diya jaaeyga aur us se koi daakhil na hoga."
"921","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key raastey mein do cheezein kharch karey to Jannat key darwaazon se pukaara jaaeyga: Ae Allah key bandey! Ye bhalai hai. Phir jo namaz walon mein se hoga wo namaz key darwaazey se bulaaya jaaeyga. Aur jo jihaad walon mein se hoga wo jihaad key darwaazey se bulaaya jaaeyga. Aur jo rozey walon mein se hoga wo Rayyaan key darwaazey se bulaaya jaaeyga. Aur jo sadqa walon mein se hoga wo sadqey key darwaazey se bulaaya jaaeyga. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Merey maan baap Aap par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! Jisey un darwaazon se bulaaya jaaeyga us par koi sakhti nahi hai. To kya koi un tamaam darwaazon se bulaaya jaaeyga? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Aur mujhey ummeed hai ke tum un mein se hogey. (Bukhari: 1897)"
"922","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aata hai to Jannat key darwaazey khol diye jaatey hain. (Bukhari: 1898)"
"923","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ka mahina daakhil hota hai to aasmaan key darwaazey khol diye jaatey hain aur Jahannum key darwaazey band kar diye jaatey hain aur shaitaano ko zanjeeron mein baandh diya jaata hai. (Bukhari: 1899)"
"924","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum usey dekho to rozah rakkho. Aur jab tum usey dekho to iftaar karo. Phir agar tum par baadal ho jaey to uskey liye andaza karo. Yaani Ramazan ka chaand. (Bukhari: 1900)"
"925","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo jhoothi baat aur us par amal karna na chhorey to Allah ko haajat nahi hai ke wo apna khaana aur apna peena chhorey. (Bukhari: 1903)"
"926","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) guzri hui hadees: Aadam key betey ka har amal uskey liye hai magar rozah, beshak wo merey liye hai aur main uska badla dunga. Aur uskey aakhir mein farmaya: Rozeydaar key liye do khushiyaan hain jin se wo khush hota hai: Jab iftaar karta hai to khush hota hai. Aur jab apne Rab se milta hai to apne rozey se khush hota hai. (Bukhari: 1904)"
"927","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo nikaah ki taaqat rakkhey to use nikaah karna chaahiye. Beshak wo nigaah key liye zyada jhukaanay wala hai aur sharmgaah key liye zyada bachaane wala hai. Aur jo taaqat na rakkhey to us par rozah laazim hai, beshak wo uskey liye (khwaahish) todney wala hai. (Bukhari: 1905)"
"928","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahina untees raaton ka hai. To rozah na rakkho yahan tak ke use dekho. Phir agar tum par baadal ho jaey to ginti tees poori karo. (Bukhari: 1907)"
"929","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon se mahina bhar eela kya. Phir jab untees din guzar gaey to subah ya shaam tashreef laaey. To Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak tum ne qasam khai thi ke mahina bhar daakhil na hogey. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mahina untees dinon ka hota hai. (Bukhari: 1910)"
"930","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Do mahiney kam nahi hotey: Eid key mahiney, Ramazan aur Zul Hijja. (Bukhari: 1912)"
"931","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ham ummi ummat hain. Na likhtey hain aur na hisaab kartey hain. Mahina aisa aur aisa hai. Yaani aik martaba untees aur aik martaba tees. (Bukhari: 1913)"
"932","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Ramazan se aik ya do din (pehley) rozah rakh kar aagey na badhey. Magar ye ke aadmi ho jo apna rozah rakhta tha, to use us din rozah rakhna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 1914)"
"933","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba jab aadmi rozey se hota aur iftaar ka waqt aata aur wo iftaar karney se pehley so jaata to apni raat aur apna din na khaata yahan tak ke shaam hoti. Aur Qais bin Sirma Ansaari rozey se they. Phir jab iftaar ka waqt aaya to apni biwi key paas aey aur us se kaha: Kya tumharey paas khaana hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin main jaati hun aur tumharey liye talaash karti hun. Aur wo apna din kaam kartey they aur unki aankhein un par ghaalib aa gaein. To unki biwi unkey paas aaein. Phir jab unhey dekha to kaha: Tumhaari kharaabi ho! Phir jab aadha din hua to wo behosh ho gaey. To uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya gaya. To ye aayat naazil hui: (Tumharey liye rozey ki raat mein apni biwiyon se milna halaal kya gaya hai). To wo us se bahut khush huey. Aur naazil hui: (Aur khaao aur piyo yahan tak ke tumharey liye safed dhaaga kaaley dhaagey se waazeh ho jaey). (Bukhari: 1915)"
"934","[AI-translation] Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab (Tumharey liye safed dhaaga kaaley dhaagey se waazeh ho jaey tak) naazil hui to main ne kaaley iqaal aur safed iqaal ki taraf qasd kya aur unhey apne takiye key neechey rakkha. To main raat ko dekhney laga aur mujhey waazeh na hota. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas subah aaya aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo raat ki siyaahi aur din ki safedi hai. (Bukhari: 1916)"
"935","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath sehri ki, phir Aap namaz key liye uthay. Main ne kaha: Azaan aur sehri key darmiyaan kitna (faasla tha)? Unhon-ne kaha: Pachaas aayaton key qadr. (Bukhari: 1921)"
"936","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri karo, beshak sehri mein barkat hai. (Bukhari: 1923)"
"937","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aashura key din aik aadmi ko bheja jo logon mein elaan karey: Beshak jo kha chuka wo poori karey ya rozah rakkhey. Aur jo na khaaya ho wo na khaey. (Bukhari: 1924)"
"938","[AI-translation] Aisha aur Umm Salma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Fajr paati jabke Aap apne ghar walon se junbi hotey, phir ghusl kartey aur rozah rakhtey. (Bukhari: 1925)"
"939","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bosa detey aur lipt-tey jabke Aap rozey se hotey. Aur Aap tum mein apni khwaahish par sab se zyada qaabu rakhney waley they. (Bukhari: 1927)"
"940","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab bhool kar khaaya piya to use apna rozah poora karna chaahiye. Beshak use Allah ne khilaaya aur pilaaya hai. (Bukhari: 1933)"
"941","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baithey they ke Aap key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main halaak ho gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua? Us ne kaha: Main apni biwi par waaqe hua jabke main rozey se tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum gardan paatey ho jisey aazaad karo? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum taaqat rakhtey ho ke do mahiney lagataar rozey rakkho? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum saaath miskeenon ko khaana khilaanay ki taaqat rakhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) thehrey. Phir jabke ham usi par they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tokra laaya gaya jis mein khajoorein thein. Aur tokra daali hui tokri hai. Aap ne farmaya: Poochhney wala kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Main. Aap ne farmaya: Use lo aur us se sadqa karo. To aadmi ne kaha: Kya mujh se zyada faqueer par Ya Rasulullah? To Allah ki qasam! Un donon kinaron key darmiyaan, yaani donon pathreeli zameenon key, merey ghar walon se zyada faqueer ghar waley nahi hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansay yahan tak ke Aapki daadhein zaahir huin, phir farmaya: Use apne ghar walon ko khilao."
"942","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seenghi lagwaai jabke Aap ehraam baandhey huey they aur seenghi lagwaai jabke Aap rozey se they. (Bukhari: 1938)"
"943","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they. To Aap ne aik aadmi se farmaya: Utro aur merey liye sattu ghoolo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Sooraj hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur merey liye sattu ghoolo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Sooraj hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur merey liye sattu ghoolo. To wo utra aur us ne Aap key liye ghoola aur Aap ne piya. Phir Aap ne apne haath se yahaan ishaara kya, phir farmaya: Jab tum raat ko yahaan se aata hua dekho to rozeydaar ne iftaar kar liya. (Bukhari: 1941)"
"944","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke Hamza bin Amr Aslami ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Kya main safar mein rozah rakkhun? Aur wo bahut rozey rakhtey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaaaho to rozah rakkho aur agar chaaaho to iftaar karo. (Bukhari: 1943)"
"945","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan mein Makkah ki taraf nikley. To rozah rakkha yahan tak ke Kadeed tak pahunchey aur iftaar kya. To logon ne iftaar kya. (Bukhari: 1944)"
"946","[AI-translation] Abu Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key baaz safaron mein garmi key din nikley yahan tak ke aadmi sakht garmi ki wajah se apna haath apne sar par rakkhey. Aur ham mein rozey se koi na tha magar jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein se aur Ibn Rawaaha mein se tha. (Bukhari: 1945)"
"947","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein they. To bheed dekhi aur aadmi jis par saaya kya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Rozey se hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Safar mein rozah rakhna neki mein se nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1946)"
"948","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar kartey they. To rozeydaar iftaar karney waley par aib na lagaata aur na iftaar karney wala rozeydaar par. (Bukhari: 1947)"
"949","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mara jabke us par rozey they to uski taraf se uska wali rozah rakkhey. (Bukhari: 1952)"
"950","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri waalida faut huin aur un par mahiney key rozey hain. To kya main unki taraf se qaza karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To Allah ka qarz ada kiye jaaney ka zyada haqdaar hai. (Bukhari: 1953)"
"951","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees aur Nabi ka qaul: Hamaarey liye utro aur ghoolo, qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Jab tum raat ko yahaan se aata hua dekho to rozeydaar ne iftaar kar liya. Aur Aap ne apni ungli se mashriq ki taraf ishaara kya. (Bukhari: 1956)"
"952","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log bhalai mein rahengey jab tak iftaar mein jaldi karengey. (Bukhari: 1957)"
"953","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein baadal waley din iftaar kya, phir sooraj nikal aaya. (Bukhari: 1959)"
"954","[AI-translation] Rubayyi bint Muawwiz se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aashura ki subah Ansaar ki bastiyon ki taraf bheja: Jo iftaar karney wala subah karey to apne baaqi din ko poora karey. Aur jo rozey se subah karey to rozah rakkhey. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham uskey baad rozah rakhtey they aur apne bachchon ko rozah rakhwaatey they. Aur unkey liye oon key khilauney banaatey they. Phir jab un mein se koi khaaney par rota to use wo detey yahan tak ke iftaar ka waqt hota. (Bukhari: 1960)"
"955","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wisaal na karo. Phir tum mein se jo wisaal karna chaahaaey to sehri tak wisaal karey. (Bukhari: 1963)"
"956","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne un se kaha: Amal mein se utna karo jitni taaqat rakhtey ho. (Bukhari: 1966)"
"957","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Salmaan aur Abu Darda key darmiyaan bhai chaara karaaya. To Salmaan Abu Darda ki ziyaarat key liye aey aur Umm Darda ko puraney kapdon mein dekha. To unhon-ne un se kaha: Tumhara kya haal hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhara bhai Abu Darda, usey duniya mein haajat nahi hai. To Abu Darda aey aur uskey liye khaana banaaya. To kaha: Khaao. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main rozey se hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Main khaanay wala nahi hun yahan tak ke tum khaao. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne khaaya. Phir jab raat hui to Abu Darda khada honay chaley. Unhon-ne kaha: So jao. To wo so gaey. Phir khada honay chaley. To unhon-ne kaha: So jao. Phir jab aakhri raat hui to Salmaan ne kaha: Ab utho. To donon ne namaz padhi. To Salmaan ne us se kaha: Beshak tumharey Rab ka tum par haq hai. Aur tumhaari jaan ka tum par haq hai. Aur tumharey ghar walon ka tum par haq hai. To har haq waley ko uska haq do. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salmaan ne sach kaha. (Bukhari: 1968)"
"958","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rozah rakhtey yahan tak ke ham kehtey ke Aap iftaar na karengey. Aur iftaar kartey yahan tak ke ham kehtey ke Aap rozah na rakkhengey. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mahiney key rozey poora kartey huey nahi dekha magar Ramazan. Aur main ne Aap ko Shaban se zyada rozey rakhtey huey nahi dekha. (Bukhari: 1969)"
"959","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rozah rakhtey yahan tak ke ham kehtey ke Aap iftaar na karengey. Aur iftaar kartey yahan tak ke ham kehtey ke Aap rozah na rakkhengey. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mahiney key rozey poora kartey huey nahi dekha magar Ramazan. Aur main ne Aap ko Shaban se zyada rozey rakhtey huey nahi dekha. (Bukhari: 1969)"
"960","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur un se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key rozey key baarey mein poochha gaya tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Main mahiney mein Aap ko rozey se dekhna na pasand karta magar dekhta. Aur na iftaar se magar dekhta. Aur na raat mein khadey honay wala magar dekhta. Aur na sotey huey magar dekhta. Aur main ne khazz aur resham ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheli se zyada naram nahi chhua. Aur main ne musk aur itr ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khushbu se zyada umda khushbu wala nahi soongha."
"961","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: To Abdullah budhey honay key baad kehtey they: Kaash main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rukhsat qabool kar leta."
"962","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: To Abdullah budhey honay key baad kehtey they: Kaash main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rukhsat qabool kar leta."
"963","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai ke jab unhon-ne Dawood (Alaihissalam) key rozey ka zikr kya to Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo jab muqaabla karta to bhaagta na tha. Abdullah ne kaha: Mujhey iskey sath kaun Ae Allah key Nabi? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamesha rozah rakkhey us ne rozah na rakkha. Do martaba. (Bukhari: 1977)"
"964","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Umm Sulaim key paas daakhil huey. To wo Aap key paas khajoor aur ghee laaein. Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghee ko uski mashkiza mein aur apni khajoor ko uskey bartan mein wapas karo. Beshak main rozey se hun. Phir Aap ghar key aik koney ki taraf uthay aur farz key siwa namaz padhi. To Umm Sulaim aur uskey ghar walon key liye dua ki. To Umm Sulaim ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri chhoti khaas (tamanna) hai. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhara khaadim Anas. To Aap ne merey liye aakhirat aur duniya ki koi bhalai na chhodi magar merey liye dua ki. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Use maal aur aulaad dey aur usey us mein barkat dey. To beshak main Ansaar mein sab se zyada maal wala hun. Aur meri beti Umaina ne mujhey bayan kya ke Hajjaaj key Basra aaney se pehley meri aulaad mein aik sau bees se zyada dafan kiye gaey. (Bukhari: 1982)"
"965","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne us se ya aik aadmi se poochha aur farmaya: Ae Abu fulaan! Kya tum ne is mahiney key aakhir mein rozah na rakkha? Aadmi ne kaha: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab tum iftaar karo to do din rozah rakkho. Aur aik riwayat mein hai unhi se, unhon-ne kaha: Shaban key aakhir mein se. (Bukhari: 1983)"
"966","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jumuah key din rozey se mana kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. (Bukhari: 1984). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum mein se koi Jumuah key din rozah na rakkhey magar us se pehley ya uskey baad din (mila kar). (1985). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"967","[AI-translation] Juwairiya bint Haaris (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah key din unkey paas daakhil huey jabke wo rozey se thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne kal rozah rakkha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chaahteen ho ke kal rozah rakkho? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To iftaar karo. (Bukhari: 1986)"
"968","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dinon mein se kisi ko khaas kartey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ka amal hamesha (rehney wala) tha. Aur tum mein se kaun taaqat rakhta hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) taaqat rakhtey they. (Bukhari: 1987)"
"969","[AI-translation] Aisha aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ayaam-e-Tashreeq mein rozey ki rukhsat na di gai magar uskey liye jo qurbaani na paaey. (Bukhari: 1997-1998)"
"970","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aashura ka din Quraish jaahiliyat mein rozah rakhtey they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) use rozah rakhtey they. Phir jab Aap Madina tashreef laaey to use rozah rakkha aur uskey rozey ka hukm diya. Phir jab Ramazan farz hua to Aashura key din ko chhor diya. To jo chaahe use rozah rakkhey aur jo chaahe chhorey. (Bukhari: 2002). Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Aashura key din jis saal unhon-ne Hajj kya mimbar par kehtey huey: Ae Madina walon! Tumharey ulema kahaan hain? Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ye Aashura ka din hai aur Allah ne tum par uska rozah nahi likha hai. Aur main rozey se hun. To jo chaahe rozah rakkhey aur jo chaahe iftaar karey. (2003). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"971","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashreef laaey aur Yahood ko Aashura key din rozah rakhtey huey dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye nek din hai. Ye din hai jis mein Allah ne Bani Israel ko unkey dushman se najaat di. To Musa ne use rozah rakkha. Aap ne farmaya: To main Musa ka tum se zyada haqdaar hun. To Aap ne use rozah rakkha aur uskey rozey ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 2004). Taraweeh ki namaz ki kitaab."
